# ORACLY — Photorealistic Art + Asset Pipeline

Canonical art governance: `docs/GLOBAL_VISUAL_QUALITY_SYSTEM.md`  
Canonical art detail: `docs/PHOTOREALISTIC_ART_STANDARD.md`  
Canonical pipeline: `docs/PHOTOREALISTIC_IMAGE_ASSET_PIPELINE.md`  
Tooling: `tool/oracly_image_pipeline/`

## Before any new major image asset

Must be: **photorealistic · cinematic · editorial · physically believable** — real materials, light, depth.

Shared DNA: near-black · midnight navy · deep violet · antique gold · warm ivory · realistic lighting · cinematic depth · natural DoF.

Feature identity must match `docs/GLOBAL_VISUAL_QUALITY_SYSTEM.md` (Coffee = ritual cup; OR ≠ giant orb/mascot; etc.).

**No text / logos / feature names / badges inside images** — Flutter owns all copy.

## Pipeline (mandatory)

1. QC against Global Visual Quality System + art standard (reject illustration look)
2. Save master under `art_masters/<feature>/` (not shipped)
3. `python tool/oracly_image_pipeline/optimize_asset.py --in … --out lib/assets/images/… --role <role> [--thumb …]`
4. Register in `AppAssets` + `pubspec` folder
5. Wire with stable `AspectRatio` / `BoxFit.cover`
6. Optional: `python tool/oracly_image_pipeline/audit_runtime.py`

Roles: `hero_wide` · `hero_tall` · `discovery_tile` · `plate_square` · `backdrop` · `banner` · `thumb`

## Forbidden

Illustration · vector · cartoon · anime · flat icon · generic 3D · game art · plastic humans · fake anatomy · neon magic overlays · baked UI text · shipping giant masters in the app bundle · giant OR mascot orb as primary hero

## Quality bar

Luxury cinematic photography → **PASS**. AI illustration mockup → **FAIL**.
